ZapTrail GSD Profile
===================

Active Workflow: GSD × Superpowers
- GSD = macro: project/milestone/phase lifecycle
- Superpowers = micro: task-level discipline (brainstorming, TDD, systematic-debugging, verification)

Current Phase: Foundation (ZT-001 to ZT-005)
- ZT-001: Repositorio, README, AGENTS.md, scripts e convenções
- ZT-002: Supabase local/Free e ambiente seguro
- ZT-003: Schema de workspace, membership e onboarding state
- ZT-004: Contrato WhatsAppProvider
- ZT-005: MockProvider

Next Phase: Vertical Slice (ZT-006 to ZT-010)
- ZT-006: Persistir mensagens, participantes, anexos e inbound events
- ZT-007: Pipeline semântico mínimo
- ZT-008: Objetos de gestão iniciais (Task, Decision, Opportunity, Commitment, Alert)
- ZT-009: Aplicacao web mobile-first e timeline dual
- ZT-010: Onboarding com MockProvider

Decision Records: .planning/DECISIONS.md
Project Map: .planning/PROJECT_MAP.md
Roadmap: .planning/roadmap/master.md